                                "sense_id": "d78ac0ff-50a1-399c-8f04-85c2f6296566",
                                "text": "\"How strong is the love of the country in all indwellers of towns!\" exclaimed Charles."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "49f80b44-8373-4325-8b98-db122286e9fe",
                                "sense_id": "d78ac0ff-50a1-399c-8f04-85c2f6296566",
                                "text": "But I will call the country's indwellers,\nAnd with soft words th' assembly will persuade[.]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8cac364-84b5-488c-852a-99e2fd6cee38",
                                "sense_id": "d78ac0ff-50a1-399c-8f04-85c2f6296566",
                                "text": "\"Only the bodies, of which this eternal, imperishable, incomprehensible Self is the indweller, are said to have an end.\""
                            }
